  m_Name: Carta_ColetaSeletiva
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Coleta Seletiva
  _titleEn: Recycling Collection
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Separar o lixo recicl\xE1vel do org\xE2nico reduz o que vai para o aterro
    e gera renda com a venda de materiais."
  _summaryEn: Separating recyclables from organic waste reduces what goes to landfill
    and generates income from selling materials.
  _realWorld: "A Pol\xEDtica Nacional de Res\xEDduos S\xF3lidos, de 2010, obriga
    os munic\xEDpios a planejar a gest\xE3o do lixo e prev\xEA a inclus\xE3o das
    cooperativas de catadores."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's National Solid Waste Policy of 2010 requires municipalities
    to plan waste management and calls for including waste picker cooperatives.
  _tradeOffs: "A coleta separada custa mais que a comum, o pre\xE7o dos recicl\xE1veis
    oscila e o programa depende da ades\xE3o dos moradores."
  _tradeOffsEn: Separate collection costs more than regular collection, recyclable
    prices swing and the program depends on residents taking part.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 12.305/2010 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2007-2010/2010/lei/l12305.htm
